{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgso2DbCvJYak6RNYDRMJ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The cause was Vibe's Keychain lookup, not the OpenRouter key. I fixed `run-vibe.sh` and wrote the details to `ANSWER.md`. The fix is uncommitted.\n\n**Cause:** Vibe's Rust front end (`vibe-rs`) reads `MISTRAL_API_KEY` from the macOS Keychain at start-up, even though OpenRouter is the active provider. It runs `/usr/bin/security`, which `agent.sb` denies, so the run exits with code 2 before doing any work.\n\n**Fix:** `run-vibe.sh` now sets `VIBE_TEST_DISABLE_KEYRING=1` on the `env -i` line. The sandbox is unchanged.\n\n**Colleague's note:** I did not use their main suggestion, `MISTRAL_API_KEY=unused`. The default config merges in a Mistral provider. With a non-empty `MISTRAL_API_KEY`, that provider counts as credentialed, which enables `web_search` and Mistral-bound utility calls. That would send content to Mistral, which the sandbox is meant to prevent. The note is right that the failure is the `/usr/bin/security` denial and that the sandbox must stay. The `VIBE_TEST_DISABLE_KEYRING` switch is the one part I used, though its name suggests a test switch, so re-check it after Vibe upgrades.\n\n**Verification:**\n- Before the fix, with a dummy key: exit 2 and the Keychain error, as in the log.\n- After the fix: the Keychain line is gone and Vibe reaches OpenRouter, failing with \"Invalid API key (from env var OPENROUTER_API_KEY)\". That one request used the prompt \"say hi\" and a dummy key.\n- Inside the sandbox, `/usr/bin/security` still fails with \"Operation not permitted\".\n\nI did not watch network traffic, so \"no Mistral calls\" rests on reading the code and a Python check that the Mistral key resolves to nothing. I have not run a real end-to-end completion. I restored the tracked `logs/last-run.*` files to their original contents."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1777,"cache_read_input_tokens":67195,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1777},"output_tokens":5,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"9d755755-d17e-400c-8de5-db0e9131e058","uuid":"218b8459-1e4c-4996-9a9c-2aefc20ac60b","timestamp":"2026-11-09T18:03:10.139Z","request_id":"req_011Cgso2DR36gYLEZRPbJAoD"}
